            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "STS references NIST 800-88 for media sanitization and can support documentation for HIPAA, ISO 27001, SOC 2, and DoD 5220.22-M related procedures when applicable. The correct process depends on equipment, data, policy, and customer requirements."
